# Run 2026-10-31, worldgen block W2: meta batch (SQ-META31) and spawn boxes (SQ-SB) in one fresh normal world.
# prep: group B seed 8675309, difficulty=normal, spawn-monsters=true, spawn-animals=true; srv toml
# [worldgen.meta_structures] log = true. Each /locate may take up to 300 s (the timeout); waitlog uses 330.
# Spawn rows: a creative bot (counts as a player for spawning, mobs leave it alone) stands at the box edge;
# mob types are counted per structure with execute-if-entity (one line per type, "count: N").
pace 2

## SQ-META31-01 | metas take slots, replacements, no part errors
bootexpect meta structure\(s\) take slots
bootexpect 4 replacement\(s\)
bootreject (?i)share above 100
bootreject failed to generate as a part
look meta count 13 higher than the 10-30 W30 boots (perf/sessions or the WG30 rows' logs)

## SQ-SB-01 | spawn boxes load
bootexpect \[spawn-boxes\].*15 box\(es\)
bootreject \[spawn-boxes\].*(no pool|no entity type|is in box)
> pbot spawn qa 0 120 0 minecraft:overworld creative
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set 18000
look after the first spawns the log has "N structure(s) boxed" (about 75); re-check at the end of the batch

## SQ-META31-02 | sky metas: clouds, balloons, sky village islands
> locate structure creativeengineering:meta/cloud_cluster
waitlog nearest creativeengineering:meta/cloud_cluster is at|type "?creativeengineering:meta/cloud_cluster|creativeengineering:meta/cloud_cluster.*timed out 330
> locate structure creativeengineering:meta/balloon_fleet
waitlog nearest creativeengineering:meta/balloon_fleet is at|type "?creativeengineering:meta/balloon_fleet|creativeengineering:meta/balloon_fleet.*timed out 330
