waitlog nearest creativeengineering:meta/sky_village_islands is at|type "?creativeengineering:meta/sky_village_islands|creativeengineering:meta/sky_village_islands.*timed out 330
count nearest creativeengineering:meta/(cloud_cluster|balloon_fleet|cloud_balloons|sky_village_islands) is at == 4
look meta log lines: 2-4 clouds, 2-6 balloons, 1-2 of each, 2-5 islands near the sky village height and none inside it (ST-307, ST-308); visual check in the client block at the logged positions

